            <ArticleTitle>World Wide Web resources for cancer support groups.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>69-73</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>World Wide Web (internet) resources that pertain to cancer support groups, especially pain and symptom control, are listed and reviewed. How to start using these services; services for patients, families, and friends; disease-specific websites; and other types of electronic information repositories are discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
